msgstr ""
"Gebruik deze optie om de Lightbox in of uit te schakelen in alle berichten "
"of pagina's"

#: inc/settings/glg-lightbox-settings.php:55
msgid "Slideshow Auto Play"
msgstr "Diavoorstelling Autoplay"

#: inc/settings/glg-lightbox-settings.php:58
